<div class="family-terms">
    <strong>Family viewing and downloads</strong>
    <p>Each customer can invite three family recipients per concert. Accept within 14 days, then enjoy up to 30 days of access. The concert’s original access expiry may shorten this period.</p>
    <p>Where downloads are enabled, save one copy of each shared video. Up to <strong>three download requests per video</strong> are allowed for retries or mistakes. Renewing an invitation does not reset that allowance. A request does not prove the file finished downloading.</p>
    <p>Your invitation is personal: verify the invited email address and do not forward the link or publish these videos. One active playback window is allowed per invitation. Verification in another browser replaces your previous verified session. Saved copies cannot be recalled; activity outside DancePro cannot be tracked.</p>
    <p>DancePro records acceptance, approximate playback activity and download requests. The sender, DancePro and authorised studio managers can see this activity. Invitation contact details are removed 180 days after expiry or revocation; usage totals are retained for support and abuse prevention. Videos may include other performers: keep them within your family and respect the studio’s privacy rules.</p>
</div>
